<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67405" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηλό-βοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grazed by sheep</i>,
			epith. of pastoral districts, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				12.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				548
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώραν μ. ἀνιέναι</span>
			turn a district <i>into a sheep-walk</i>, i.e. lay it waste, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				14.31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.473
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.87
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηράσατο εἰς ἀεὶ μηλόβοτον
				εἶναι</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν
			Καρχηδόνα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.103
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mund.
			</span></i>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. γυναίοις τὴν ἀρχὴν ἀνῆκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					5.27
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>VS</u>
				1.21.4
			</span></i>.</div>
